# Torvus Bog 0g_swamp_hall layer 3: CPlantScarabSwarm e0c1e00b6, psc6 launch 1.
# The player stands among the boids and shifts position a few times so the swarm keeps taking attack
# slots (SpawnGrenades only walks the POI list while its slot has a boid), 1200 frames, fast.
@f220 layer 3
@f300 god 1; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; give missile 250; give chargeBeam 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1; fastmorph 1
@f380 send e001e00b6 Activate
@f420 tp -153.0 -66.0 37.0
@f600 obj e001e00b6
@f700 tp -151.0 -66.5 36.5
@f900 obj e001e00b6
@f1000 tp -149.5 -67.0 37.5
@f1100 obj e001e00b6
@f1190 obj e001e00b6
